With roguelikes, the best option is to get used to diagonals.  If
you're using the number pad, it should be easy to adapt by practicing
word processing and office applications buy not using the standard
arrow key section.  Otherwise, you may have to find some coping
methods.

Learning touch typing may help, as it teaches the concept of one finger
managing about 4 keys at once, and is easily transferrable to the
roguelike keyset.



